"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A glacier collapse likely caused the floods on Wednesday in the Himalayan border region, killing at least 626 people, according to authorities. Some of the most dramatic footage from the deadly flash flooding is not being shown to the public in China.\",            \"english_title\": \"Glacier Collapse Causes Floods\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un glaciar se cay\u00f3 y caus\u00f3 inundaciones el mi\u00e9rcoles en la regi\u00f3n de la frontera del Himalaya, matando al menos a 626 personas, seg\u00fan las autoridades. Algunos de los videos m\u00e1s dram\u00e1ticos de las inundaciones no se muestran al p\u00fablico en China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Colapso de Glaciar Causa Inundaciones\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Len\u00edn Moreno says he did not take bribes from a Chinese company to get a contract to build a hydroelectric plant.\",            \"english_title\": \"Len\u00edn Moreno Denies Bribes\",            \"translated_version\": \"Len\u00edn Moreno dice que no tom\u00f3 sobornos de una empresa china para obtener un contrato para construir una planta hidroel\u00e9ctrica.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Len\u00edn Moreno Niega Sobornos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A woman who rented homes to two al-Qaeda members talks publicly for the first time to the BBC.\",            \"english_title\": \"Woman Talks About Renting to al-Qaeda\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer que alquil\u00f3 casas a dos miembros de al-Qaeda habla p\u00fablicamente por primera vez con la BBC.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Mujer Habla Sobre Alquilar a al-Qaeda\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An investigation has started into the storage of weapons for Ukraine's military near a residential area.\",            \"english_title\": \"Investigation on Weapon Storage\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ha comenzado una investigaci\u00f3n sobre el almacenamiento de armas para el ej\u00e9rcito de Ucrania cerca de una zona residencial.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Investigaci\u00f3n Sobre Almacenamiento de Armas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Haakon VIII gave an emotional tribute to his late father, Harald V, and talked about how he wants to rule.\",            \"english_title\": \"Haakon VIII's Tribute to Father\",            \"translated_version\": \"Haakon VIII dio un homenaje emocional a su difunto padre, Harald V, y habl\u00f3 sobre c\u00f3mo quiere gobernar.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Homenaje de Haakon VIII a su Padre\"        }    ]}"